Can you wait a little bit ?

10
00:02:43,476 --> 00:02:44,684
Please .

11
00:02:50,059 --> 00:02:52,184
Wait here , I 'll call you shortly .

12
00:02:55,684 --> 00:02:58,977
Excuse me , Cida . You were talking about your conditions .

13
00:02:59,185 --> 00:03:02,310
Yes , I only take care of children up to 3 years old .

14
00:03:02,477 --> 00:03:06,560
This is the first stage of childhood , the most important for development .

15
00:03:06,769 --> 00:03:08,977
- After this time , I leave . - I see .

16
00:03:09,144 --> 00:03:10,435
But don 't worry ...

17
00:03:10,603 --> 00:03:14,019
It is normal for new mothers to feel insecure .

18
00:03:14,728 --> 00:03:15,911
I know the stages of pregnancy .

19
00:03:15,936 --> 00:03:18,769
