30
00:03:58,314 --> 00:04:01,106
No I didn 't . Things got complicated .

31
00:04:01,272 --> 00:04:04,272
I had to leave , but I would like to finish them .

32
00:04:05,648 --> 00:04:09,523
You also looked after kids at school .

33
00:04:09,690 --> 00:04:12,814
- Do you like children ? - Sure . Who doesn 't ?

34
00:04:15,648 --> 00:04:17,982
- Do you have children ? No , I 'm alone .

35
00:04:18,316 --> 00:04:19,357
All right .

36
