82
00:07:37,621 --> 00:07:38,911
Good .

83
00:07:40,496 --> 00:07:41,788
Very well .

84
00:07:44,996 --> 00:07:47,454
And now slowly exhale .

85
00:07:47,704 --> 00:07:48,954
Very good .

86
00:07:55,663 --> 00:07:57,122
