This is the TV room .

93
00:08:27,291 --> 00:08:30,624
My bedroom is at the end of the hall . There is a bathroom there .

94
00:08:31,082 --> 00:08:33,457
This will be the baby 's room .

95
00:08:33,625 --> 00:08:35,957
