106
00:09:34,004 --> 00:09:38,004
I need someone to accompany me all day .

107
00:09:38,170 --> 00:09:41,420
Someone discreet . I hate gossip .

108
00:09:45,088 --> 00:09:47,713
Let 's go to the kitchen to discuss money .

109
00:10:04,693 --> 00:10:06,193
GOOD MANNERS

110
00:10:21,298 --> 00:10:22,715
Stormy night

111
00:10:22,882 --> 00:10:24,882
Raindrops outside

112
