The landlord called . You did not pay the rent .

206
00:20:53,966 --> 00:20:55,633
A new blouse ?

207
00:20:56,133 --> 00:20:58,466
Yes , I bought it at the mall .

208
00:20:58,883 --> 00:21:00,050
I like it .

209
